graph TB
    subgraph "Process Virtual Address Space (64-bit Linux)"
        A[0x0000 0000 0000 0000] -->|Program Code| B[Text Segment .text]
        B -->|Read-Only Data| C[Data Segment .rodata]
        C -->|Initialized Data| D[Data Segment .data]
        D -->|Uninitialized Data| E[BSS Segment .bss]
        E -->|↓ Heap grows up| F[Heap malloc/free]
        F -->|...| G[Memory Mapping mmap]
        G -->|...| H[Shared Libraries libc.so]
        H -->|↑ Stack grows down| I[Stack local vars]
        I --> J[0x7FFF FFFF FFFF]
    end
    
    subgraph "Physical RAM"
        K[Page Tables]
        L[Physical Pages]
    end
    
    F -.->|MMU Translation| L
    I -.->|MMU Translation| L
    
    style B fill:#e1f5ff
    style F fill:#e8f5e8
    style I fill:#ffe1e1
    style K fill:#fff4e1
